## Cloud Model Processing

The user-selected model provider (local or remote) processes text and images sent to it.
The user must have the legal right to process the materials and provide appropriate
authorization. Using this skill does not constitute authorization to transmit materials
to any specific service. No additional OCR, email, or URL transmission beyond the
model channel is performed without explicit user instruction.

## Descriptions

- **jsonschema**: JSON Schema validation library (Draft-07 support via Draft7Validator).
- **attrs**: Python class boilerplate library (jsonschema dependency).
- **jsonschema-specifications**: JSON Schema meta-schemas for jsonschema (Draft-07, etc.).
- **referencing**: JSON Schema reference resolution library (local registry only in this skill).
- **rpds-py**: Persistent data structures (Rust-backed, used by referencing).
- **typing_extensions**: Backported typing features for Python < 3.13.
